Subject: [PATCH 2/4] =?UTF-8?q?Nanquim:=20jato=20no=20toque=20=E2=80=94=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?tri=C3=A2ngulo=20da=20roda=20agrupado=20e=20mem=C3=B3ria=20com?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20teto?=
